<title>CHINA: China to issue 1.0752 bln yuan 3-year power bonds.</title>
<headline>China to issue 1.0752 bln yuan 3-year power bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Ministry of Electric Power will issue 1.0752 billion yuan worth of three-year bonds at annual interest of 11 percent, the Xinhua news agency said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
